This repository contains two kinds of work, and only one of them is mine to
license. Please read NOTICE.md first.

1. THE ORIGINAL GAME

   "The Secret of Arendarvon Castle" (Addison-Wesley, 1984/85) by Hal Renko &
   Sam Edwards with Arend Rensink: its logic, text, world data, puzzles, the
   ALADIN virtual machine and its bytecode, in whatever form they appear here.

   Copyright remains with the authors and/or their publisher's successor. No
   license is granted over it by me, because none is mine to grant. The
   engine in this repository is a translation of that program and embeds its
   text and data, so it is a derivative work: using it requires the rights
   holders' permission, not merely mine.

